cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HuSS Scorer, please cite it as below."
title: "HuSS Scorer"
abstract: >-
  Semi-automatic, offline scorer for HuSS (Human-Scaled Section) drawings: a person drawn to a
  reference height and the remembered section of a space give estimates of ceiling height and
  depth. The tool aligns scanned sheets, suggests the figure, ceiling and wall, and lets a rater
  confirm or correct; it merges, reports and compares the results.
type: software
